      "source": [
        "# 1. For loops and `range()`\n",
        "\n",
        "A `for` loop visits each value in a sequence. `range()` generates a sequence of integers; its stop value is excluded."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "for i in range(1, 6):\n",
        "    print(i)"
      ]
    },
